00:10:32,727 --> 00:10:38,727
The Mule is a crime, drama film directed by Clint Eastwood.

3
00:15:49,090 --> 00:15:55,090
Earl Stone, a man in his eighties, is broke, alone, and facing foreclosure of his
business when he is offered a job that simply requires him to drive.

4
00:21:05,454 --> 00:21:11,454
Easy enough, but, unbeknownst to Earl, he's just signed on
as a drug courier for a Mexican cartel.

5
00:26:21,818 --> 00:26:27,818
He does so well that his cargo increases exponentially, and Earl hit
the radar of hard-charging DEA agent Colin Bates.

6
